{"id":"demon_slayer_hashira_training_drill_sane","lines":[{"t":3.484,"end":7.828,"chars":[0],"who":"Sanemi","text":"Wind Breathing, Fourth Form…","de":"Wind Atmung, vierte Form …","orig":"scenes/demon_slayer_hashira_training_drill_sane/lines_de/01.mp3"},{"t":8.46,"end":11.004,"chars":[0],"who":"Sanemi","text":"Rising Dust Cyclone!","de":"Aufsteigender Staubzyklon","orig":"scenes/demon_slayer_hashira_training_drill_sane/lines_de/02.mp3"},{"t":11.097,"end":16.545,"chars":[1],"who":"Obanai","text":"Serpent Breathing, Fifth Form: Winding Serpent!","de":"Schlangen Atmung, fünfte Form: Gewundene Schlange","orig":"scenes/demon_slayer_hashira_training_drill_sane/lines_de/03.mp3"},{"t":17.72,"end":18.7,"chars":[0],"who":"Sanemi","text":"(getting hit)","de":"*getroffen werden*","orig":"scenes/demon_slayer_hashira_training_drill_sane/lines_de/04.mp3"},{"t":19.82,"end":22.22,"chars":[0],"who":"Sanemi","text":"(breathing)","de":"*atmen","orig":"scenes/demon_slayer_hashira_training_drill_sane/lines_de/05.mp3"},{"t":22.224,"end":24,"chars":[0],"who":"Sanemi","text":"A draw again…","de":"Wieder Unentschieden...","orig":"scenes/demon_slayer_hashira_training_drill_sane/lines_de/06.mp3"},{"t":23.936,"end":26,"chars":[1],"who":"Obanai","text":"Seems like it, doesn't it.","de":"Sieht ganz so aus, was?","orig":"scenes/demon_slayer_hashira_training_drill_sane/lines_de/07.mp3"},{"t":27.575,"end":29.623,"chars":[2],"who":"Muichiro","text":"Mind if I join in?","de":"Wie siehts aus darf ich auch mitmachen?","orig":"scenes/demon_slayer_hashira_training_drill_sane/lines_de/08.mp3"},{"t":30.276,"end":32,"chars":[1],"who":"Obanai","text":"Muichiro…","de":"Muichiro...","orig":"scenes/demon_slayer_hashira_training_drill_sane/lines_de/09.mp3"},{"t":32.761,"end":36.317,"chars":[0],"who":"Sanemi","text":"You don't exactly live nearby, and you make the trip every night.","de":"Du bist ja nicht gerade in der nähe, und nimmst den weg jede nacht auf dich","orig":"scenes/demon_slayer_hashira_training_drill_sane/lines_de/10.mp3"},{"t":36.375,"end":39.567,"chars":[0],"who":"Sanemi","text":"Hope you'll still be fit for training tomorrow.","de":"Na hoffentlich bist du morgen auch wieder fit fürs training","orig":"scenes/demon_slayer_hashira_training_drill_sane/lines_de/11.mp3"},{"t":39.567,"end":43.185,"chars":[2],"who":"Muichiro","text":"The corps members I train don't notice any of this.","de":"De truppenmitglieder die ich trainiere bekommen von all dem nichts mit","orig":"scenes/demon_slayer_hashira_training_drill_sane/lines_de/12.mp3"},{"t":43.185,"end":45.497,"chars":[2],"who":"Muichiro","text":"Besides, training with them doesn't challenge me.","de":"Außerdem fordert mich das training mitihnen nicht","orig":"scenes/demon_slayer_hashira_training_drill_sane/lines_de/13.mp3"},{"t":45.497,"end":47.377,"chars":[0],"who":"Sanemi","text":"Heh, makes sense.","de":"Heh, verständlich","orig":"scenes/demon_slayer_hashira_training_drill_sane/lines_de/14.mp3"},{"t":47.149,"end":47.849,"chars":[1],"who":"Obanai","text":"Heh.","de":"heh","orig":"scenes/demon_slayer_hashira_training_drill_sane/lines_de/15.mp3"},{"t":47.681,"end":52.433,"chars":[0],"who":"Sanemi","text":"Daily training gets us nowhere. We only make progress when we challenge each other.","de":"das tägliche training bringt nichts. wir machen nur fortschritte wenn wir uns gegenseitig herausfordern","orig":"scenes/demon_slayer_hashira_training_drill_sane/lines_de/16.mp3"},{"t":52.496,"end":56.7,"chars":[2],"who":"Muichiro","text":"I see… then let's drop the niceties and get serious.","de":"Ach so... dann sollten wir die nettigkeiten ablegen, und mal ernst machen","orig":"scenes/demon_slayer_hashira_training_drill_sane/lines_de/17.mp3"},{"t":56.786,"end":65.41,"chars":[1],"who":"Obanai","text":"Agreed… and as a sign of our respect… Sanemi and I… will take you on two against one. Got it?","de":"Einverstanden.. und als zeichen unserer anerkennung... werden sanemi und ich... zu zweit gegen dich antretten. Alles klar?","orig":"scenes/demon_slayer_hashira_training_drill_sane/lines_de/18.mp3"},{"t":65.41,"end":66.795,"chars":[1],"who":"Obanai","text":"And here we go!","de":"Und Los Gehts!","orig":"scenes/demon_slayer_hashira_training_drill_sane/lines_de/19.mp3"},{"t":66.8,"end":70.312,"chars":[2],"who":"Muichiro","text":"Two against one, huh? How unfair.","de":"Zwei gegen einen, ja? Wie unfair","orig":"scenes/demon_slayer_hashira_training_drill_sane/lines_de/20.mp3"},{"t":70.37,"end":73.498,"chars":[2],"who":"Muichiro","text":"But fine… brace yourselves… Ready!","de":"Aber gut... haltet euch... Bereit!","orig":"scenes/demon_slayer_hashira_training_drill_sane/lines_de/21.mp3"},{"t":74.791,"end":76.327,"chars":[1],"who":"Obanai","text":"Hmph?!","de":"Hmpf?!","orig":"scenes/demon_slayer_hashira_training_drill_sane/lines_de/22.mp3"},{"t":76.7,"end":77.9,"chars":[0],"who":"Sanemi","text":"(confused)","de":"*verwirrt*","orig":"scenes/demon_slayer_hashira_training_drill_sane/lines_de/23.mp3"},{"t":77.86,"end":80.36,"chars":[0],"who":"Sanemi","text":"(winds up and strikes)","de":"*ausholen zum schlag, und dann zuschlagen*","orig":"scenes/demon_slayer_hashira_training_drill_sane/lines_de/24.mp3"},{"t":80.777,"end":82.377,"chars":[0],"who":"Sanemi","text":"(gets thrown away)","de":"*weggeworfen werden*","orig":"scenes/demon_slayer_hashira_training_drill_sane/lines_de/25.mp3"},{"t":90,"end":95.732,"chars":[3],"who":"Kasugai Crow","text":"Keep it up! Finish them both! You're simply unmatched!","de":"Weiter so! Mach die beiden Fertig! du bist einfach unvergleichlich!","orig":"scenes/demon_slayer_hashira_training_drill_sane/lines_de/26.mp3"},{"t":95.199,"end":96.735,"chars":[0],"who":"Sanemi","text":"BEAK SHUT!","de":"SCHNABEL!","orig":"scenes/demon_slayer_hashira_training_drill_sane/lines_de/27.mp3"},{"t":96.502,"end":97.926,"chars":[3],"who":"Kasugai Crow","text":"HAAA","de":"HAAA","orig":"scenes/demon_slayer_hashira_training_drill_sane/lines_de/28.mp3"}]}